{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ② 조건·반복·리스트","level":2,"title":"대문자 개수","desc":"<p>문자열에서 <b>대문자 알파벳의 개수</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>count_upper(s)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def count_upper(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def count_upper(s):\n    n = 0\n    for ch in s:\n        if ch.isupper():\n            n += 1\n    return n\n","hint":"<p><code>ch.isupper()</code> 는 대문자이면 <code>True</code>예요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"count_upper(\"Hello World\")","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"count_upper(\"abc\")","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"count_upper(\"ABC\")","expected":3,"visible":false},{"call":"count_upper(\"\")","expected":0,"visible":false}],"id":"py-317"}